  "description": {
   "en": "At the age of 36, Zhou Xingchen passed away due to liver cancer, leaving Lin Feiran to spend the rest of his life in solitude, guarding Zhou Xingchen’s belongings. \nBut when he opened his eyes again, Lin Feiran had been reborn, returning to his university days. He sought out Zhou Xingchen, who was then only 21 and attending the same school.\nThis time, their encounter came seven years earlier…"
  },
